{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃ〜ん！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobDCWFLg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちはこんばんは\n小津玲奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気が付けば5月、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "早いものですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "活動を復帰してから1ヶ月が過ぎたということで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短いながら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "内容がギュッと濃縮された"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こい1ヶ月でした🎏"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "濃いといえば、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は濃いめのブラックコーヒーが大好き☕️\nだからいつもコーヒーカフェを巡って\n美味しいコーヒー探しの旅に出ています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家でコーヒーを淹れて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゼラチンで固めてコーヒーゼリーを作るのにも"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハマっているんだ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家カフェを1人で開いて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1人で楽しんでいます☕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さてさて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここで１つ発表があります"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうご存知の方もいらっしゃるとは思いますが、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私、小津"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「桜橋を教えてくれた」のMVに\n参加しております！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え！！！どこにいるかって？？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "えへへ\nナイショです🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ探し当ててみてください！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一発でわかったら\n桜橋マスターです🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わからなくても大丈夫👌\n私も3回目でやっと気がつきました🤭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "急遽でしたが\n出演する準備を整えてくださった\nスタッフの皆さま、\n本当にありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりに6期生に会えて\nとってもとっても楽しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっとオフショットが出せるから\nいっぱい出しちゃう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みつきと一緒にお土産を食べているところ📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob1PrAeY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobeEbLhD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーのオフショットを撮る係に任命され\n一生懸命撮っていました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "デジカメは初体験だったけど\nとっても楽しかったのでハマってしまいそう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "近くにいたここね、もえかとも\n写真を撮れたの📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobuKUWIk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob2jIDiI.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もちろん✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お土産大好き人間として\nしっかりちゃっかり\nたくさんのお土産を買いました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マグロ美味しかったなぁ🍣\nマグロまん（肉まんのマグロ版）も\n味が濃くて肉汁たっぷりで\nとっても美味しかったの！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またみんなでお土産を買いたいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂工事中にも復帰させていただいて\n久しぶりにバナナマンのお二人にも\nご挨拶ができて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日々が濃厚で素敵な毎日です💓💓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからも濃ゆい人生を送りたいな！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "答え合わせの時間です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は桜橋を教えてくれたのMVで\n何役をしているでしょうか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "◯◯⚪︎◯◯◯◯◯◯◯"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☕️🍹🍛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カフェめぐりって楽しいよね！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVの2:07を\nいっぱい観てね！"}], "source": "official"}